  },
  "segment_count": 60,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 6.57,
      "end": 8.92,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "text": "PROFESSOR: Hello and welcome to the help session on"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 8.92,
      "end": 10.22,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "text": "complementation."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 10.22,
      "end": 13.14,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "Today, we will briefly be reviewing the concept of"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.14,
      "end": 14.4,
      "duration": 1.26,
      "text": "complementation."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 16.87,
      "duration": 2.47,
      "text": "And then, we will discuss complementation with a"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 16.87,
      "end": 19.32,
      "duration": 2.45,
      "text": "non-biological example."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 19.32,
      "end": 24.25,
      "duration": 4.93,
      "text": "So to begin, complementation is generally used to determine"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 24.25,
      "end": 28.09,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "text": "if two mutations fall in the same gene or if they fall in"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 28.09,
      "end": 29.39,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "text": "different genes."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 29.39,
      "end": 33.47,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "So here, we have two mutants-- mutant one and mutant two."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 33.47,
      "end": 36.82,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "text": "Both of these have mutations in the"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 36.82,
      "end": 38.88,
      "duration": 2.06,
      "text": "lysine biogenesis pathway."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 38.88,
      "end": 42.39,
      "duration": 3.51,
      "text": "So on their own, they cannot produce lysine."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 42.39,
      "end": 45.82,
      "duration": 3.43,
      "text": "To determine if these mutations fall in the same"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 45.82,
      "end": 49.71,
      "duration": 3.89,
      "text": "gene or in different genes, we need to cross the two mutants"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 49.71,
      "end": 53.25,
      "duration": 3.54,
      "text": "together and examine their progeny."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 53.25,
      "end": 58.04,
      "duration": 4.79,
      "text": "If the progeny can grow, this means that the two mutations"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 58.04,
      "end": 61.01,
      "duration": 2.97,
      "text": "were in different genes, and thus, they"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 61.01,
      "end": 63.16,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "text": "complement each other."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 63.16,
      "end": 68.69,
      "duration": 5.53,
      "text": "However, if the progeny cannot grow, this means that the two"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 68.69,
      "end": 72.73,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "mutations were in the same gene, and they do not"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 72.73,
      "end": 74.91,
      "duration": 2.18,
      "text": "complement each other."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 74.91,
      "end": 76.55,
      "duration": 1.64,
      "text": "So now, let me explain"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 76.55,
      "end": 78.57,
      "duration": 2.02,
      "text": "complementation yet another way."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 82.06,
      "end": 84.77,
      "duration": 2.71,
      "text": "So over here, we have the knitting pathway."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 84.77,
      "end": 87.33,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "text": "It's very simple and straightforward."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 87.33,
      "end": 89.575,
      "duration": 2.245,
      "text": "In order to knit, you need two things."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 92.29,
      "end": 96.2,
      "duration": 3.91,
      "text": "You need both the knitting needles and you need yarn."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 96.2,
      "end": 99.17,
      "duration": 2.97,
      "text": "When you have both of these things together, you can knit"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 99.17,
      "end": 100.88,
      "duration": 1.71,
      "text": "a nice scarf."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 100.88,
      "end": 104.2,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "text": "So to explain how this is related to complementation, I"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 104.2,
      "end": 106.645,
      "duration": 2.445,
      "text": "have brought along my friend Robert to give us a hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 110.98,
      "end": 111.8,
      "duration": 0.82,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 111.8,
      "end": 116.6,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "text": "So in the first scenario, we're going to have me with"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 116.6,
      "end": 119.83,
      "duration": 3.23,
      "text": "yarn and Robert with needles."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 119.83,
      "end": 125.06,
      "duration": 5.23,
      "text": "When I have yarn, I can't knit by myself, because I am"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 125.06,
      "end": 126.64,
      "duration": 1.58,
      "text": "lacking needles."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 126.64,
      "end": 129.699,
      "duration": 3.059,
      "text": "This is equivalent to having a mutation in what we'll call"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 129.699,
      "end": 131.84,
      "duration": 2.141,
      "text": "the gene for needles."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 131.84,
      "end": 136.31,
      "duration": 4.47,
      "text": "Robert, on the other hand, has needles, but by himself, he"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 136.31,
      "end": 137.52,
      "duration": 1.21,
      "text": "has no yarn."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 137.52,
      "end": 139.46,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "text": "So he can't knit."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 139.46,
      "end": 142.55,
      "duration": 3.09,
      "text": "So alone, neither of us are able to knit."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 142.55,
      "end": 146.87,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "However, if we team up and we work together and we share our"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 146.87,
      "end": 152.35,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "text": "resources, now we have both yarn and needles, so we can"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 152.35,
      "end": 155.21,
      "duration": 2.86,
      "text": "knit a nice scarf."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 155.21,
      "end": 155.81,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 155.81,
      "end": 157.6,
      "duration": 1.79,
      "text": "So how about the case of non-complementation?"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 162.32,
      "end": 167.17,
      "duration": 4.85,
      "text": "If I have needles now, and Robert also has needles, me by"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 167.17,
      "end": 170.77,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "text": "myself, I cannot knit, because I have a mutation in that I"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 170.77,
      "end": 172.59,
      "duration": 1.82,
      "text": "have to no yarn."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 172.59,
      "end": 177.03,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "Robert also has needles and he also does not have yarn."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 177.03,
      "end": 180.07,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "text": "So by himself, he can't knit either."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 180.07,
      "end": 183.8,
      "duration": 3.73,
      "text": "This time, when we team up and we try to work together, even"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 183.8,
      "end": 186.91,
      "duration": 3.11,
      "text": "if we share our needles, we still can't knit, because we"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 186.91,
      "end": 188.08,
      "duration": 1.17,
      "text": "have no yarn."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 188.08,
      "end": 191.46,
      "duration": 3.38,
      "text": "So this is the case of non-complementation."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 191.46,
      "end": 194.04,
      "duration": 2.58,
      "text": "Thanks, Robert."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 194.04,
      "end": 197.21,
      "duration": 3.17,
      "text": "This concludes the help session on complementation."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 197.21,
      "end": 198.46,
      "duration": 1.25,
      "text": "Thanks for joining us."
    }
  ],
